            <h2>Why Choose Our Jerseys?</h2>
            <p>Every stitch matters. We source officially licensed gear so you can represent your team with pride.</p>
            <p>Whether you’re cheering from the stands or showing off your fandom on the streets of Nairobi, our jerseys are designed to make you feel like part of the action.</p>
            <p>Experience the thrill of the game with our premium football jerseys. Shop now and wear your passion on your sleeve!</p>
            <P>We offer free deliveries within Nairobi CBD and payment is done after delivery</P>
            <p>You can check more inspos at our instagram page @Jersey_s.p.o.r.t</p>
        </section>
